{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-10-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>2006年港姐冠軍陳茵媺（Aimee）與陳豪結婚13年，婚後二人恩愛如昔，並育有兩子一女，是圈中公認的模範夫妻。向來視子女為命根的他們，日前特意拋下三個寶貝仔女，飛往韓國首爾享受溫馨的二人世界。沒有了照顧小朋友的重擔，陳茵媺顯得格外輕鬆自在，近日在社交平台上載了一段手持鮮花，在陽光沐浴下展現甜美笑容的唯美短片，並感性寫道「My time to Make myself a priority is now」（現在是時候將自己放在首位），散發出愜意與幸福。</p>\n<h2>陳茵媺吊帶背心大晒宏偉身材</h2>\n<p>陳茵媺在自拍的IG限時動態中，暫時卸下媽媽身分實行「大解放」，罕有地穿上一件黑色低胸吊帶小背心出鏡。鏡頭前的她皮膚白皙緊緻、臉色紅潤，配上清爽短髮與精緻的金色圓環耳環，整個人散發出逆齡的少女感。最吸睛的莫過於她那保養得宜的火辣身材，貼身的低胸剪裁將其豐滿上圍展露無遺，生了三個小朋友依然線條緊緻，毫無贅肉，令網民紛紛大讚她是「最美辣媽」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺結婚10多年，恩愛如昔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e40b19bea8e3a9d224e2334cae350bf5/2023-02/aimeechan_official_331169313_587659899560303_5548429869616900452_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺育有兩子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d828bb89e5e5452c8f5e9dcb9a18a9b2/2026-04/aimeechan_official_1775016000_3865347934380852699_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺於2024年跟老公陳豪拍攝「韓風」相，慶祝結婚11周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8257e99a9c4838ff00ea94650ec39c6/2024-06/303_1_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與陳豪的「韓風」相P圖太重手，導致二人走晒樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b31d75c7c05f48744703eb67b130f74/2024-06/304_0_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺夫妻檔吸金。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8d5e950b900e7a6b4578829cbddf332/2026-10/SaveClip_App_736296549_18419929885179827_5959450921069536563_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺穿上低胸吊帶背心，大晒傲人身材與白皙緊緻肌膚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf8c84ad3a50f8ef0275f3f2ad77b1df/2026-10/SaveClip_App_798017699_18430061167179827_2491657156943113984_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與陳豪2025年慶祝12周年時，選擇田園風。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf4cf7be4bfad9153efe0cd21bdbf3e5/2026-06/Aimee_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與陳豪拖住手，好甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d62b853aa6b4808f56c6aa3f9dd16c9b/2026-06/Aimee_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺早前在IG發文，慶祝結婚13周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e884a534d53990633a7b81b9f9e02549/2026-06/Aimee_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺今年慶祝結婚周年，穿上婚紗拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57c01a49e8c2fa364546042fd958675a/2026-06/Aimee_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺在鏡頭前展露燦爛笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20331767e2555253c9e3e4dadc0e11bc/2026-06/Aimee_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺大晒美背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5956d6601f0388c9265d94a020718a11/2026-06/Aimee_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺晒出單人相，未見老公陳豪出鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e9729eb1a209ec8de2cafcbe0fabff8/2026-06/Aimee_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺早前慶祝生日，大晒巨鑽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/683eaaa649dc28d55941fb67310a8b7b/2026-04/aimeechan_official_1774769652_3863370253271499460_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺於2013年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/876cb2142103272bc46799f508df2ef9/2024-06/photo-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺於2013年在法國結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64eeb9ed06968a603706ad2c59632bdb/2024-06/_66a7707.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺自結婚後，一直由陳豪賺錢養家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/580921c69cd2a4bb4c792ec342fcb4e0/2023-01/aimee_44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺嫁陳豪後過少奶奶生活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95eb960151a876f94c9f3bc2d47c5ffa/2023-06/aimeechan_official_327009937_1362101851311294_8455099422791623496_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺組成五口之家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/002317a8778a0bd2c7c5f55eea8efbfa/2023-06/aimeechan_official_328000641_3836137789946578_8682948207698909418_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺婚後甚少再接拍影視作品，專心照顧家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2be31fe8e4f1ec190fc8fad5a583e7f9/2023-06/aimeechan_official_341309216_197791269386249_9032843663914273361_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪每年會盡量抽時間跟家人慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7da98ca9b15287663e291e7aca0ae4ce/2024-04/MO_014.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺曾到酒店Staycation慶祝結婚周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9ec7ea70e95b152d6a8a349c21c0ec8/2023-06/aimeechan_official_353955084_568686622110761_1574420681016398925_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與老公陳豪慶祝結婚10周年時撐枱腳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c8ad330f86d0cf1930d5c0c9009c9fc/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--AimeeChanaimeechanofficialInstagramphotosandvideos-0_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺戴上巨鑽戒指及閃爆手鏈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dbc93d144cd3e20c00a712adb8cc7e7/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--AimeeChanaimeechanofficialInstagramphotosandvideos-0_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺歎美酒，慶祝結婚10周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb9523bc7b8aeb5d1c8920f22d34ba6d/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--AimeeChanaimeechanofficialInstagramphotosandvideos-0_18_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺晒出老公視角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/471f400f8b7f7c27513eb90f605689b4/2023-06/VideoScreenshot--AimeeChanaimeechanofficialInstagramphotosandvideos-0_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"酒店房內有個橙色紙袋，網民估計陳茵媺又收到陳豪送贈的Hermès手袋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/739e7a9942f9e26eb3070287dbc1f414/2023-06/aimeechan_official_353067481_789700089489352_8468177981946892772_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳茵媺漫步首爾街頭飽嚐美食</h2>\n<p>陳茵媺除了性感火辣的背心造型，亦大展時尚品味。在首爾街頭漫步時，她換上型格的牛仔外套，戴上紅色鴨舌帽，展現隨性活力的街頭風。陳茵媺在夜市盡情大啖當地的街頭美食，包括醬燒大蝦、抹茶雪糕以及地道啤酒應有盡有。這次首爾之行讓陳茵媺得以暫時放鬆，用最自信的姿態美出新高度。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺2006年參選港姐大熱奪冠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44e5f3483fa827269c281b68c11658c9/2023-03/ok5u3744.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"同屆亞軍是周家蔚，季軍則是呂慧儀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/673537b5a7b439129648a14e6dd56207/2023-03/ok5u4902.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺拍攝2012年劇集《心戰》飾演兄妹撻着。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aeca2a96eb1f29499d3b982a079b7154/2023-09/08_45.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺生了三個小朋友仍Keep到好身形。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a0a40e5b58daac2304c9af06bc659f7/2023-02/aimeechan_official_328941144_1614197675689957_851089305568742722_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺曾晒出過陳豪的攝影作品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f411ec08863fd59de1380fc19faa936/2023-02/photo1675231286.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺情人節收花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acb3102e9d691d339686bc268730ee2b/2023-02/aimeechan_official_331171939_566616182080739_112361835815697894_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺最愛的Hermès手袋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4eea7532f5bd8a80025321a13d3385b4/2022-10/amiee%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺亦有Mini Kelly II。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3e16275c7de20102db464e79b525a4a/2022-10/amiee%20%288%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺一身黑色型格打扮跟老公陳豪在深圳逛街，合照可見她身上的Hermès手袋非常搶眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/365f1e7255de44053cea3ff22ffc9a84/2024-01/_3_K_ism__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺曾帶子女回加拿大探親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/556b933964830060ec1c71a9b4284b91/2023-08/AIMEE_22.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺家人到三個孫好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f8e7917df8f2cc70a707b2fc3aa94f2/2023-08/aimee_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與母親雖然唔似樣，但外貌似姊妹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa319c63bc5a748e8da36e76da9efa37/2023-08/aimee_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺湊子女返港時，還獲邀請進入駕駛艙，她亦發文感謝機組人員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a0db2245545f26efbcb39d38e99471a/2023-08/Aimee_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺在駕駛艙打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e15b6da1f85d5ea86b1c99ef3be3a5a1/2023-08/Aimee_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廿四孝老公兼爸爸陳豪都有去接機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58ec04150e9ddc87f1048115e0da84d9/2023-08/Aimee_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三子女見到陳豪都好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e301dba1467af584b678d46d03e6cbb/2023-08/Aimee_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與奶奶關係一向密切。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/562742e7f5d9e4bf51ad3673b26f7870/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1699104750_3228647115345292618_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺經常陪奶奶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b6349b86d73ce8ba99617175149f035/2023-12/MO9_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺早前分享與兩個囝囝去迪士尼的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3582429ef77c48a1df35d630fbe15b46/2024-01/aimeechan_official_1706441722_3290194097561460568_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"欣賞著名鋼琴家郎朗世界級演奏，但細女未有同行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ccad52d292374a43c44ca2eb9ee89ab/2024-01/aimeechan_official_1706441722_3290194097570043893_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪一家曾到葡萄牙及西班牙巴塞隆拿玩。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1632b83e3d0ca37f614939416fbd5128/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1703629163_3266600639755678284_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪的媽媽及哥哥都有同行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ab7be0baa0d7363e9f74a7692d5f174/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1703628366_3266593957675785217_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與老婆都很孝順。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b1335f1935f90860423429a6c02544d/2023-12/MO11_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺湊住三個子女去溜冰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec1e6a8fff9aa84c969fa0a62414f13d/2023-10/snapinsta.app_393049435_6967687043262268_9071303634227391736_n_1440.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪到內地開工時，三個小朋友曾北上探班。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbbeb5e34655226658626a9d6ddf96a0/2023-10/snapinsta.app_393052270_987745145660097_7863057318100321815_n_1440.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T05:19:01.626536+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":584,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}